<title>USA: Harte-Hanks increases qtly dividend to $0.02/shr.</title>
<headline>Harte-Hanks increases qtly dividend to $0.02/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harte-Hanks Communications Inc on Thursday said it boosted its regular quarterly dividend to $0.02 cents a share from $0.016 cents.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on December 16 to holders of record on December 2. It is the first increase since the company began paying quarterly dividends in March 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
